'''Ms. Sign''' (カンバン娘, ''Kanban Musume'', '''Signboard Girl''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] and [[Legend Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].

